#. ja: これは<if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if>、ご苦労様であります！<br>ご不明な点があれば、何なりとお尋ねください。
#. de: Guten <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Abend<else>Morgen</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Tag<else>Abend</if></if>, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Benötigt Ihr Auskunft? Wenn Ihr Fragen habt, will ich versuchen, sie Euch zu beantworten.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><nbsp>! Si certains détails de notre opération vous ont échappé, je peux vous faire un topo, vous n'avez qu'à demander<nbsp>!
