msgctxt "custom/007/RegIsb5CampBrokenGlass_00751:TEXT_REGISB5CAMPBROKENGLASS_00751_ROCHILDA_000_001:1"
msgid "Greetings, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>. If you wish to know aught of the current situation, you've come to the right person."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これは<if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if>、ご無事で……！<br>突然姿が見えなくなったと聞き、僭越ながら心配しておりました。<br>ご不明な点があれば、何なりとお尋ねください。
#. de: Ah, <if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Ihr seid unversehrt! Ich hatte mir schon Sorgen gemacht, als Ihr plötzlich verschwunden wart. Benötigt Ihr Auskunft? Wenn Ihr Fragen habt, will ich versuchen, sie Euch zu beantworten.
#. fr: <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><nbsp>! Contente de vous voir <if $gn4>saine et sauve<else>sain et sauf</if><nbsp>! Non pas que je vous sous-estime, mais je me suis inquiétée quand vous avez sou<shy>dai<shy>ne<shy>ment disparu<if $gn4>e</if>. Si vous avez des questions, vous n'avez qu'à me demander<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
