msgctxt "custom/007/RegIsb5CampBrokenGlass_00751:TEXT_REGISB5CAMPBROKENGLASS_00751_ROCHILDA_000_002:1"
msgid "It is heartening to see you safe, <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>. Forgive me for saying, but your disappearance couldn't have come at a worse time, so we're all relieved that some semblance of peace has finally been restored to the camp. So, how can I be of assistance?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: これは<if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if>、<br>バブイルの塔への突入任務、ご苦労様でありました！<br>ご不明な点があれば、何なりとお尋ねください。
#. de: <if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Herzlichen Glückwunsch zur erfolgreichen Erstürmung des Turms von Babil! Benötigt Ihr Auskunft? Wenn Ihr Fragen habt, will ich versuchen, sie Euch zu beantworten.
#. fr: <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><nbsp>! Bravo pour votre in<shy>fil<shy>tra<shy>tion de la tour de Babil. Une affaire rondement menée. Si vous avez des questions, vous n'avez qu'à me demander<nbsp>!
msgctxt "custom/007/RegIsb5CampBrokenGlass_00751:TEXT_REGISB5CAMPBROKENGLASS_00751_ROCHILDA_000_003:1"
msgid "The Tower of Babil has at last been overthrown, though with you leading the charge, our victory was never in doubt. I, on the other hand, have been overseeing our work here, so if there's anything you'd like to know, just ask."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これは<if ($gn52 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><split " " 2><string $gs1></split><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if>……。<br>現在この一帯には終末の影響が見られます。<br>どうか最大限のご警戒を……！
#. de: <if ($gn52 > 0)><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split><nbsp>... Diese Gegend wird derzeit von Endzeitphänomenen heimgesucht. Bitte lasst äußerste Vorsicht walten.
#. fr: <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><nbsp>! Les effets de l'apocalypse se font sentir ici aussi. Quoi que vous fassiez, procédez avec la plus grande prudence<nbsp>!
