msgctxt "custom/007/RegIsb5CampBrokenGlass_00751:TEXT_REGISB5CAMPBROKENGLASS_00751_ROCHILDA_000_004:1"
msgid "<if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split>? What brings you back to Ilsabard? I would advise against staying here overlong. The situation is dire indeed."
msgstr ""

#. ja: これは<split " " 2><string $gs1></split>殿……！<br>上官より、あなた方の活躍によって終末が払われたと聞き及び、<br>感謝の念を伝えたいと考えていたところであります！
#. de: <if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if><else><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if><else><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></if></if> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split>! Ich habe gehört, dass dank Eures heldenhaften Einsatzes die Apokalypse gerade noch einmal verhindert werden konnte. Dafür gebührt Euch mein aufrichtiger Dank.
#. fr: <if ($gn52 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankLimsaFemaleText $gn52 0><else><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn53 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankGridaniaFemaleText $gn53 0><else><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><capitalize><if ($gn54 > 0)><if $gn4><sheet GCRankUldahFemaleText $gn54 0><else><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 0></if></if></capitalize> <split " " 2><string $gs1></split></if><nbsp>! Nos supérieurs nous ont communiqué votre victoire. Je me demandais justement quand vous alliez passer par ici pour que je vous remercie en personne<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 0></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
